<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal confirms Saudis taking Petrogal stake.</title>
<headline>Portugal confirms Saudis taking Petrogal stake.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Economy Ministry confirmed on Thursday that Portugal had reached an agreement in principle with Saudi Aramco for the Saudi Arabian state oil company to take a 27.5 percent stake in state-controlled energy group Petrogal.</p>
</text>
